SUMMARY:New contribution limits for 2027
DESCRIPTION:401(k)\, 403(b) and 457: $25\,500 (catch-up at 50+: $8\,500\; 
 at 60–63: $11\,750). IRA: $7\,500 (catch-up $1\,100). HSA: $4\,500 self
 -only\, $9\,000 family. From IRS news release IR-2026-136 (Nov 12\, 2026)
  and Rev. Proc. 2026-24. Check your own plan's rules too. Source: IRS.
URL:https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/401k-limit-increases-to-25500-for-2027-ir
 a-limit-remains-7500
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
